Description
===========
Run autostart_blocking.sh and autostart.sh from the dwm config directory
on startup.

From dwm-autostart-20210120-cb3f58a.diff. That file declares
localshare = ".local/share" but its code reads localconfig, so it does not
compile as published; the declaration is localconfig = ".config" here,
which is the path its sprintf calls build.

Applies to
==========
dwm git master, commit 44dbc68 (2026-03-13)

